//! _evaluate_expression — main expression dispatch function.
//!
//! 1:1 port of `src/evaluator/exprs/_expr.ts`.
//!
//! Dispatches every AstExpr node kind to the appropriate sub-evaluator.
//! The profiler instrumentation from the TypeScript version is omitted (Node.js-specific).
pragma(Pragma.AllowUnsafe);
